          "type": "listicle2section1",
          "name": "Premium product showcase",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5 Reasons People Are Adding Reniva to Their Daily Hair Care Routine",
            "paragraph_1": "It’s not a multivitamin. It’s not a hair growth pill. It’s the one step most hair care routines are missing.",
