            "paragraph_7": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "vertical_padding": 20,
            "image_max_width": 300,
            "image_border_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "<p>1. No More Piling On Products</p>",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Most people end up layering five different bottles trying to manage hair fall — a serum here, a supplement there. Reniva manages root strength and scalp health daily in one shampoo, so you’re not stacking products just to keep up.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
            "paragraph_size": 16,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "text_color": "#121212",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "listicle2blog2_dpzmym": {
          "type": "listicle2blog2",
          "name": "Blog split layout33",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_7": "",
            "paragraph_6": "",
            "paragraph_5": "",
            "paragraph_4": "",
            "background_color": "#000000",
            "heading": "<p>2. Scalp Irritation Calms Down Without Harsh Chemicals</p>",
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Harsh sulfates strip your scalp’s natural barrier, which is why irritation creeps up over time. Reniva is formulated without harsh sulfates, using Thuja Orientalis to calm the scalp the way it’s meant to be calmed. No stripping. No irritation.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_size": 16,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_bg_color": "#3b5998",
            "button_hover_bg_color": "#2d4373",
            "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "button_font_size": 16,
