            "paragraph_7": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "vertical_padding": 20,
            "image_max_width": 300,
            "image_border_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "<p>3. It Actually Strengthens Strands. Rinse-Out Conditioner Doesn’t</p>",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Rinse-out conditioner smooths the surface. One mechanism. Reniva reinforces the strand from within using Hydrolyzed Oat Protein, working through the fiber itself. That’s the difference between covering the symptom and actually addressing it.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
            "paragraph_size": 16,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "text_color": "#121212",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "listicle2blog2_r9wQ8D": {
          "type": "listicle2blog2",
          "name": "Blog split layout33",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_7": "",
            "paragraph_6": "",
            "paragraph_5": "",
            "paragraph_4": "",
            "background_color": "#000000",
            "heading": "<p>4. Makes Your Routine Work Without The Tradeoff</p>",
            "paragraph_1": "<p>Daily washing keeps your hair clean and fresh. But harsh formulas strip it out every time you lather up. Reniva removes the tradeoff — you get a clean wash without your scalp’s health being the price you pay.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_size": 16,
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_bg_color": "#3b5998",
            "button_hover_bg_color": "#2d4373",
            "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "button_font_size": 16,
            "button_border_radius": 30,
            "image_size": 300
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "listicle2blog_Y9zjDk": {
          "type": "listicle2blog",
          "name": "Blog split layout3",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_4": "",
            "paragraph_5": "",
            "paragraph_6": "",
            "paragraph_7": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "vertical_padding": 20,
            "image_max_width": 300,
            "image_border_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "<p>5. One Bottle Replaces Five Random Products</p>",
            "heading_size": 32,
            "paragraph_1": "<p>A scalp serum. A leave-in treatment. A clarifying shampoo. A hair mask. A separate conditioner. Most people are stacking all of it and guessing. Reniva is one formula with real botanical concentrations across the board. Five ingredients. Five mechanisms. One wash. Done.</p>",
            "paragraph_2": "",
            "paragraph_3": "",
